{
    "title": "Dino Merge Master Animal Fight",
    "description": "Enter a world full of dinosaurs with Dino Merge! Something strange has brought these dinosaurs back, and now it\u2019s your job to help them grow. Merge two of the same dinosaurs to become the ultimate Merge Dinosaur master and discover new, stronger species. As you build your dino team, get ready for exciting Animal Battle and Monster Fight. The more you merge, the more amazing creatures you can unlock. It\u2019s easy to play, fun for everyone, and full of surprises. Start your adventure now and become the top Merge Master in the dinosaur world!\r\n\r\nKEY FEATURES:\r\n- Easy Merging: Combine two of the same dinosaurs to become a top Dino Merge master.\r\n- Fun Fights: Battle with your dinosaurs in exciting Animal Fight and Monster Fight.\r\n- Cool Discoveries: Find new and powerful dinosaurs as you play.\r\n- Build Your World: Create a fantastic dinosaur kingdom.\r\n- Fun for All: Simple and enjoyable for everyone.\r\n- Lots of Surprises: Discover hidden secrets and surprises.\r\n\r\nHOW TO PLAY:\r\n1. Merge Dinosaurs: Drag two of the same dinosaurs together to create a new, stronger one.\r\n2. Discover New Dinosaurs: Keep merging to find different and rare dinosaurs.\r\n3. Animal Battle: Use your dinosaurs in fun Animal Fight and Monster Fight.\r\n4. Build Your World: Use your dinosaurs to make and grow your dinosaur kingdom.\r\n\r\nIn Dino Merge, you step into a world where dinosaurs have come back to life after a strange event. Your task is to become a merge master and merge two of the same dinosaurs to create new and stronger ones. Engage in thrilling Animal Fight and exciting Monster Fight with your growing dino team. Build and expand your own dinosaur kingdom while uncovering rare and amazing dinosaurs. With easy to learn gameplay and lots of surprises, Dino Merge is a fun and engaging game that\u2019s perfect for anyone who loves adventure and discovery.\r\n\r\n===============================\r\n\r\nDo you like our game?  Any suggestion?  Feel free to let us know at \"contact@questzy.io\"",
    "descriptionHTML": "Enter a world full of dinosaurs with Dino Merge! Something strange has brought these dinosaurs back, and now it\u2019s your job to help them grow. Merge two of the same dinosaurs to become the ultimate Merge Dinosaur master and discover new, stronger species. As you build your dino team, get ready for exciting Animal Battle and Monster Fight. The more you merge, the more amazing creatures you can unlock. It\u2019s easy to play, fun for everyone, and full of surprises. Start your adventure now and become the top Merge Master in the dinosaur world!<br><br>KEY FEATURES:<br>- Easy Merging: Combine two of the same dinosaurs to become a top Dino Merge master.<br>- Fun Fights: Battle with your dinosaurs in exciting Animal Fight and Monster Fight.<br>- Cool Discoveries: Find new and powerful dinosaurs as you play.<br>- Build Your World: Create a fantastic dinosaur kingdom.<br>- Fun for All: Simple and enjoyable for everyone.<br>- Lots of Surprises: Discover hidden secrets and surprises.<br><br>HOW TO PLAY:<br>1. Merge Dinosaurs: Drag two of the same dinosaurs together to create a new, stronger one.<br>2. Discover New Dinosaurs: Keep merging to find different and rare dinosaurs.<br>3. Animal Battle: Use your dinosaurs in fun Animal Fight and Monster Fight.<br>4. Build Your World: Use your dinosaurs to make and grow your dinosaur kingdom.<br><br>In Dino Merge, you step into a world where dinosaurs have come back to life after a strange event. Your task is to become a merge master and merge two of the same dinosaurs to create new and stronger ones. Engage in thrilling Animal Fight and exciting Monster Fight with your growing dino team. Build and expand your own dinosaur kingdom while uncovering rare and amazing dinosaurs. With easy to learn gameplay and lots of surprises, Dino Merge is a fun and engaging game that\u2019s perfect for anyone who loves adventure and discovery.<br><br>===============================<br><br>Do you like our game?  Any suggestion?  Feel free to let us know at &quot;contact@questzy.io&quot;",
